{"route":"/docs/5.3/utilities/object-fit/","version":"5.3","renderedVersion":"5.3","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Object fit","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use the object fit utilities to modify how the content of a replaced element, such as an <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> or <code>&lt;video&gt;</code>, should be resized to fit its container."},"blocks":[{"id":"how-it-works","type":"heading","en":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Change the value of the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/object-fit\"><code>object-fit</code> property</a> with our responsive <code>object-fit</code> utility classes. This property tells the content to fill the parent container in a variety of ways, such as preserving the aspect ratio or stretching to take up as much space as possible."},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Classes for the value of <code>object-fit</code> are named using the format <code>.object-fit-{value}</code>. Choose from the following values:"},{"id":"how-it-works--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-1","type":"item","en":"<code>contain</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-2","type":"item","en":"<code>cover</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-3","type":"item","en":"<code>fill</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-4","type":"item","en":"<code>scale</code> (for scale-down)"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-it-works--item-5","type":"item","en":"<code>none</code>"}]}]},{"id":"examples","type":"heading","en":"Examples","level":2},{"id":"examples--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add the <code>object-fit-{value}</code> class to the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Replaced_element\">replaced element</a>:"},{"id":"examples--example-1","type":"demo","key":"9ad03cf54b1cdc612e7c","height":300},{"id":"examples--code-1","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"object-fit-contain border rounded\" alt=\"...\">\n<img src=\"...\" class=\"object-fit-cover border rounded\" alt=\"...\">\n<img src=\"...\" class=\"object-fit-fill border rounded\" alt=\"...\">\n<img src=\"...\" class=\"object-fit-scale border rounded\" alt=\"...\">\n<img src=\"...\" class=\"object-fit-none border rounded\" alt=\"...\">","language":"html"},{"id":"responsive","type":"heading","en":"Responsive","level":2},{"id":"responsive--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Responsive variations also exist for each <code>object-fit</code> value using the format <code>.object-fit-{breakpoint}-{value}</code>, for the following breakpoint abbreviations: <code>sm</code>, <code>md</code>, <code>lg</code>, <code>xl</code>, and <code>xxl</code>. Classes can be combined for various effects as you need."},{"id":"responsive--example-1","type":"demo","key":"b5c686502d9851fbf20b","height":300},{"id":"responsive--code-1","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"object-fit-sm-contain border rounded\" alt=\"...\">\n<img src=\"...\" class=\"object-fit-md-contain border rounded\" alt=\"...\">\n<img src=\"...\" class=\"object-fit-lg-contain border rounded\" alt=\"...\">\n<img src=\"...\" class=\"object-fit-xl-contain border rounded\" alt=\"...\">\n<img src=\"...\" class=\"object-fit-xxl-contain border rounded\" alt=\"...\">","language":"html"},{"id":"video","type":"heading","en":"Video","level":2},{"id":"video--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The <code>.object-fit-{value}</code> and responsive <code>.object-fit-{breakpoint}-{value}</code> utilities also work on <code>&lt;video&gt;</code> elements."},{"id":"video--code-1","type":"code","value":"<video src=\"...\" class=\"object-fit-contain\" autoplay></video>\n<video src=\"...\" class=\"object-fit-cover\" autoplay></video>\n<video src=\"...\" class=\"object-fit-fill\" autoplay></video>\n<video src=\"...\" class=\"object-fit-scale\" autoplay></video>\n<video src=\"...\" class=\"object-fit-none\" autoplay></video>","language":"html"},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"sass-utilities-api","type":"heading","en":"Sass utilities API","level":3},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Object fit utilities are declared in our utilities API in <code>scss/_utilities.scss</code>. <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/utilities/api#using-the-api\">Learn how to use the utilities API.</a>"},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--code-1","type":"code","value":"\"object-fit\": (\n  responsive: true,\n  property: object-fit,\n  values: (\n    contain: contain,\n    cover: cover,\n    fill: fill,\n    scale: scale-down,\n    none: none,\n  )\n),","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"9ad03cf54b1cdc612e7c","html":" <img alt=\"Placeholder: Object fit contain\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img object-fit-contain border rounded\" height=\"120\" src=\"\" width=\"140\">\n<img alt=\"Placeholder: Object fit cover\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img object-fit-cover border rounded\" height=\"120\" src=\"\" width=\"140\">\n<img alt=\"Placeholder: Object fit fill\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img object-fit-fill border rounded\" height=\"120\" src=\"\" width=\"140\">\n<img alt=\"Placeholder: Object fit scale down\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img object-fit-scale border rounded\" height=\"120\" src=\"\" width=\"140\">\n<img alt=\"Placeholder: Object fit none\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img object-fit-none border rounded\" height=\"120\" src=\"\" width=\"140\"> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0 d-flex overflow-auto"},"sprite":""},{"key":"b5c686502d9851fbf20b","html":" <img alt=\"Placeholder: Contain on sm\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img object-fit-sm-contain border rounded\" height=\"80\" src=\"\" width=\"140\">\n<img alt=\"Placeholder: Contain on md\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img object-fit-md-contain border rounded\" height=\"80\" src=\"\" width=\"140\">\n<img alt=\"Placeholder: Contain on lg\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img object-fit-lg-contain border rounded\" height=\"80\" src=\"\" width=\"140\">\n<img alt=\"Placeholder: Contain on xl\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img object-fit-xl-contain border rounded\" height=\"80\" src=\"\" width=\"140\">\n<img alt=\"Placeholder: Contain on xxl\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img object-fit-xxl-contain border rounded\" height=\"80\" src=\"\" width=\"140\"> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0 d-flex overflow-auto"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/introduction"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/download"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/contents"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/browsers-devices"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/javascript"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/webpack"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/parcel"},{"en":"Vite","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/vite"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/accessibility"},{"en":"RFS","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/rfs"},{"en":"RTL","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/rtl"},{"en":"Contribute","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/contribute"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/overview"},{"en":"Sass","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/sass"},{"en":"Options","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/options"},{"en":"Color","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/color"},{"en":"Color modes","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/color-modes"},{"en":"Components","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/customize/components"},{"en":"CSS va